<title>SRI LANKA: Weather-Light showers seen over most of Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Weather-Light showers seen over most of Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Monday morning</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Bowathenna		0</p>
<p>    Canyon		    0</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	     0</p>
<p>    Kotmale		   0</p>
<p>    Laxapana		  2.1</p>
<p>    Moussakele		0</p>
<p>    Norton		    0</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     5.8</p>
<p>    Victoria		  0</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	    0</p>
<p>    Ukuwela		   0.8</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  7.2</p>
<p>The department forecast a few showers along the southwestern coastal areas in the morning and thundershowers in the Sabaragamuwa, Central, Uva, Northwestern and Northcentral provinces in the afternoon or evening on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
